.SH NAME
abacus-coverage - Show Gherkin step coverage report


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBabacus coverage [glob] [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Analyze feature files and report what percentage of Gherkin steps have matching actions.

.PP
Scans all .feature files matching the glob pattern (default *\fI/\fP\&.feature) and
classifies each step as exact match, fuzzy match, or suggestion.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for coverage


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--db\fP=".abacus/abacus.db"
	Path to the database file

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Output in JSON format

.PP
\fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	Suppress non-essential output

.PP
\fB--verbose\fP[=false]
	Enable verbose output


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  $ abacus coverage
  $ abacus coverage "features/*.feature"
  $ abacus coverage "tests/**/*.feature" --json
.EE


